                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-06"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Russell reports that on the 1st of February Venezuela named a
                    plenipotentiary to Colombia.)</p>
